  "body": "This happened in https://github.com/webcompat/web-bugs/issues/21952#issuecomment-447709223\r\nThis is not specified and maybe it doesn't matter just putting it here for memory.\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<div>\r\n  <object data=\"http://example.org/foo.txt\"></object>\r\n</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn WebKit and Blink, this will create a \r\n\r\n```html\r\n<pre style=\"word-wrap:break-word; pre-wrap:wrap;\">\r\n\r\ncontent of foo.txt\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n```\r\n\r\non Gecko \r\n\r\n```html\r\n<pre>\r\n\r\ncontent of foo.txt\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn blink\r\nhttps://github.com/chromium/chromium/blob/60b6acc12a2369e970f4e2fa2e3845a8e2f85de7/third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/parser/text_document_parser.cc#L51-L78\r\n\r\nThe origin is WebKit\r\nhttps://github.com/WebKit/webkit/commit/f04d886c0514bc3d575aa67980a5daa0ccf4151a\r\n\r\n",
